
@startuml

skinparam {
    DiagramBorderThickness 1
    RectangleBorderThickness 1
    SequenceParticipantBorderThickness 1
    SequenceReferenceBorderThickness 1
    SequenceGroupBorderThickness 1
    SequenceActorBorderThickness 1
    Gainsboro true
    SequenceMessageAlign center
    Monochrome true
    PartitionFontSize 10
    RoundCorner 10

}

start
floating note left: 启动周期上报时，\n调用此回调函数
while(是否在周期上报中)
:加锁;
floating note left: 依次遍历车辆状态、\nECU状态、进度、事件的报文
while (此类报文是否有缓存)
:读取此类报文的头尾节点;
:根据报文类型和尾结点的索引生成写数据库的KEY;
:根据KEY读取缓存报文;
if (上报报文到云端) then (yes)
    :删除报文体;
    :尾节点向前推进，头结点不变;
else(no)
:跳出循环;
endif
endwhile
:更新此类报文头尾节点到数据库;

:解锁;
:等待周期时间;
endwhile
stop
@enduml

